<<music victoria>>
You discover he has written down his victims' names in invisible ink. After a thorough examination you conclude that the next victim is María Luisa González.
You send a patrol to her address and... Congratulations! You caught Murderchef red-handed, before he could commit the crime. María Luisa is very grateful and your boss is going to award you a medal of honour for your excellent work.
